    "provinceDeepAtlasProfile": {
      "oneLine": "Ceulrithan is centered at -39.629771, -3.078722 under Confessional State, with 66,037,000 people across 9 settlements.",
      "extremeAtlasDescription": "Ceulrithan occupies 6,412,232.24 sq mi / 16,607,605.26 sq km of modeled Earth-sized territory, about 3.255973% of Belavadös's surface. It is not merely a province but a continent-scale civic machine: Farming, Partial forest and Beach and grass with water define its broad terrain, while its settlements intensify into Partial forest, Farming, Beach and grass with water and Beach and reefs with water. Population density is 3.976 people/sq km / 10.299 people/sq mi, which lets wilderness, roads, faction-held corridors, and vast uncrowded borders remain huge.",
      "peopleFactionsAndFaith": "The strongest public people-groups are Humans, Near-Humans, and Mixed Heritage, Halfling and Smallfolk, Animalfolk and Mammalian Anthropomorphs, Amphibious and Aquatic Peoples, Elf Parent Race and Elf Bloodlines, Dwarven and Gnomish Kin, and 2 more. Frequently recorded peoples include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Halfling — Stout Halfling, Kender, Kithkin, Harengon, Centaur, Giff, and 4 more. Faction visibility leans toward The Glasswell Institute, with worship and patronage records naming Nebyrr, Ishtanora, Iskareth, Setrimir, Raeshkul, Marduthor, Bastveig, and 3 more.",
